  Review -->|Yes and next gate requested| A2["M02 experimental UIA disposition"]
  A2 --> B1["M03 tracker and calibration"]
  B1 --> B2["M04 gestures claims and Peek"]
  B2 --> C["M05 capture storage shelf and Workspace"]
  C --> D1["M06 accessibility motion and profiling"]
  D1 --> D2["M07 offline packaging clean-host proof"]
  D2 --> Ready{"Release evidence complete?"}
  Ready -->|No| Regress["Repair and regress affected milestone"]
  Ready -->|Yes| Approval["Release candidate for approval"]
  Approval -. "Separate scoped request" .-> E["M08 optional extension RFC"]
